$r17=r($conn,$L17,'Phuong phap hoc','学习需要方法和坚持。每个人都有适合自己的学习方法。有的人喜欢早上背生词，有的人喜欢晚上复习。重要的不是学多久，而是怎么学。首先，要养成好习惯，每天花一点时间学习。其次，要记笔记，把重点记下来。第三，要多练习，把学过的内容运用到生活中。第四，要定期复习，不然学了就忘。最后，再难也不要放弃。坚持是最重要的。只要有正确的方法和努力，你的中文水平一定会提高的。','Xue xi xu yao fang fa he jian chi. Mei ge ren dou you shi he zi ji de xue xi fang fa. You de ren xi huan zao shang bei sheng ci, you de ren xi huan wan shang fu xi. Zhong yao de bu shi xue duo jiu, er shi zen me xue. Shou xian, yao yang cheng hao xi guan, mei tian hua yi dian shi jian xue xi. Qi ci, yao ji bi ji, ba zhong dian ji xia lai. Di san, yao duo lian xi, ba xue guo de nei rong yun yong dao sheng huo zhong. Di si, yao ding qi fu xi, bu ran xue le jiu wang. Zui hou, zai nan ye bu yao fang qi. Jian chi shi zui zhong yao de. Zhi yao you zheng que de fang fa he nu li, ni de zhong wen shui ping yi ding hui ti gao de.','Hoc can phuong phap va kien tri. Moi nguoi co cach phu hop. Nguoi thich hoc tu sang, nguoi thich on toi. Quan trong ko phai hoc bao lau ma la hoc the nao. Truoc het tao thoi quen tot. Tiep theo ghi chep trong tam. Thu ba luyen tap nhieu. Thu tu on tap dinh ky. Cuoi cung du kho cung ko bo cuoc. Kien tri la quan trong nhat. Co phuong phap va co gang, trinh do ban se len.','medium',200,1);
$L17l=l($conn,$L17,'Phuong phap hoc','A: Ban co phuong phap hoc tieng Trung nao hay ko? B: Co, toi ghi chep va on tap hang ngay. A: Ban co kien tri ko? B: Co gang kien tri. A: Nho chia se voi toi nhe. B: Ko van de.','A: Ni you xue xi fang fa ma? B: You, wo ji bi ji he fu xi. A: Ni jian chi ma? B: Nu li jian chi. A: Qing fen xiang gei wo. B: Mei wen ti.','A: Ban co phuong phap hoc tieng Trung ko? B: Co, toi ghi chep va on tap. A: Ban co kien tri ko? B: Co gang kien tri. A: Hay chia se cho toi. B: Ko van de.','1');
