r($conn,$L20,'Biet on cuoc song','感谢是一种美好的情感。生活中，我们要感谢很多人和事。首先，要感谢父母，感谢他们给了我们生命和无私的爱。其次，要感谢老师，感谢他们的教导和关心。还要感谢朋友，感谢他们的陪伴和支持。最后，也要感谢生活中遇到的困难和挑战，因为它们让我们成长。一个懂得感谢的人，一定是一个幸福的人。他们已经学会了珍惜身边的一切。感恩让我们的心灵更丰富，让人际关系更美好。不要等到失去才懂得珍惜，从现在开始，对身边的人说一声"谢谢"吧。生活已经给了我们很多，要学会感恩。','Gan xie shi yi zhong mei hao de qing gan. Sheng huo zhong, wo men yao gan xie hen duo ren he shi. Shou xian, yao gan xie fu mu, gan xie ta men gei le wo men sheng ming he wu si de ai. Qi ci, yao gan xie lao shi, gan xie ta men de jiao dao he guan xin. Hai yao gan xie peng you, gan xie ta men de pei ban he zhi chi. Zui hou, ye yao gan xie sheng huo zhong yu dao de kun nan he tiao zhan, yin wei ta men rang wo men cheng zhang. Yi ge dong de gan xie de ren, yi ding shi yi ge xing fu de ren. Ta men yi jing xue hui le zhen xi shen bian de yi qie. Gan en rang wo men de xin ling geng feng fu, rang ren ji guan xi geng mei hao. Bu yao deng dao shi qu cai dong de zhen xi, cong xian zai kai shi, dui shen bian de ren shuo yi sheng "xie xie" ba. Sheng huo yi jing gei le wo men hen duo, yao xue hui gan en.','Cam on la cam xuc dep. Trong song, ta cam on nhieu nguoi va viec. Truoc het, cam on cha me da cho ta song va tinh yeu. Ke tiep, cam on thay co da day va quan tam. Va cam on ban be da ben canh ung ho. Cuoi cung, cam on kho khan vi chung giup ta lon. Nguoi biet cam on la nguoi HP. Ho da biet tran trong moi thu. Biet on giup tam hon phong phu. Dung cho den khi mat moi biet quy. Hom nay hay noi "cam on" voi nguoi than. Song cho ta nhieu, hay biet on.','medium',220,1);
$L20l=l($conn,$L20,'Loi cam on','A: Ban muon cam on ai nhat? B: Toi muon cam on cha me toi. A: Vi sao? B: Vi ho da giup toi rat nhieu. A: Ban co noi voi ho chua? B: Da noi roi, hom qua toi vua noi.','A: Ni zui xiang gan xie shei? B: Wo zui xiang gan xie wo de fu mu. A: Wei shen me? B: Yin wei ta men bang zhu le wo hen duo. A: Ni dui ta men shuo le ma? B: Shuo le, zuo tian gang shuo.','A: Ban cam on ai nhat? B: Cha me toi. A: Sao? B: Vi ho giup toi nhieu. A: Ban noi voi ho chua? B: Noi roi, hom qua vua noi.','1');
